{"name":"Lucerne","hex":"#77b87c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Lucerne","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A canton of Switzerland.","The capital city of Lucerne canton, Switzerland."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Lucerne"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lucerne","blocks":[{"text":"Lucerne or Luzern is a city and a municipality in central Switzerland, in the German-speaking portion of the country. Lucerne is the capital of the canton of Lucerne and part of the district of the same name. With a population of approximately 86,700 people, Lucerne is the most populous city in Central Switzerland, and a nexus of economics, transport, culture, and media in the region. The city's urban area consists of 19 municipalities and towns with an overall population of about 247,400 people."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/L%C3%B6wendenkmal_-_panoramio.jpg/330px-L%C3%B6wendenkmal_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucerne","wikidata":"Q4191"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Luzern_Kapellbr%C3%BCcke_1180623.jpg/500px-Luzern_Kapellbr%C3%BCcke_1180623.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Luzern_Kapellbr%C3%BCcke_1180623.jpg/1280px-Luzern_Kapellbr%C3%BCcke_1180623.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Luzern_Kapellbr%C3%BCcke_1180623.jpg/500px-Luzern_Kapellbr%C3%BCcke_1180623.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALuzern_Kapellbr%C3%BCcke_1180623.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Ch%C3%A2teau_G%C3%BCtsch_-_54847907489.jpg/500px-Ch%C3%A2tea